.DS_Store
*.log

# Credentials — see design doc §10.1. Listed here rather than only in the per-project
# ignore files so a stray copy anywhere in the tree is covered, and added before the
# phases that produce them: the window in which a credential gets committed is the
# window between creating the file and remembering to ignore it.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.jks
*.keystore
*.pem
*.p12
google-services.json
*service-account*.json
firebase-adminsdk*.json
secrets.properties

# ntfy server state — the auth database holds user credentials and access tokens, and a
# server.yml would hold the same token this app authenticates with. Added now, when the file
# type is introduced, not when a file first appears.
ntfy-data/
server.yml
